From 3e4508aeae918b38def6a8289a0399c2fce42b68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xing <yyxingying@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:00:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(session-controller): session-only scope for
 session.selectModel

Add an optional `scope` to `session.selectModel`. `default` (or omitted)
keeps today's behaviour: the selection applies to the Session and is saved
as the Agent default. `session` applies the same durable `model/selection`
to that Session only and never saves the default, so other Sessions and new
Sessions are unaffected. The response echoes the applied scope.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
